   "html": "<style>\n  .hp-pane{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;background:var(--paper);\n    border:1px solid #D6D6D2;border-radius:14px;padding:44px 66px;\n    display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;overflow:hidden}\n  .hp-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:22px;color:#757570}\n  .hp-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#C96442}\n  .hp-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\n  .hp-h{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-weight:600;font-size:36px;color:#0A0A0A}\n  .hp-b{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:400;font-size:23px;color:#5C5C58}\n  .hp-rule{height:1px;background:#E8E8E5}\n</style><div class=\"hp-pane\"><div class=\"hp-bar\"><span class=\"hp-dot\"></span>preface.md</div><div class=\"hp-rule\"></div><div class=\"hp-row\"><div class=\"hp-h\">Person</div><div class=\"hp-b\">Solo founder. Building a deploy dashboard. Based in Porto.</div></div><div class=\"hp-row\"><div class=\"hp-h\">Aims</div><div class=\"hp-b\">Ship v2 this quarter without burning weekends.</div></div><div class=\"hp-row\"><div class=\"hp-h\">Craft</div><div class=\"hp-b\">Reviews everything in one block after standup.</div></div><div class=\"hp-row\"><div class=\"hp-h\">Voice</div><div class=\"hp-b\">Answer first, then what backs it.</div></div><div class=\"hp-row\"><div class=\"hp-h\">Rhythm</div><div class=\"hp-b\">Deep work 7 to 11am. No meetings Wednesdays.</div></div><div class=\"hp-row\"><div class=\"hp-h\">Limits</div><div class=\"hp-b\">Never commits to a date without a spare week.</div></div></div>",
